WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.112
On docking against NSP15, DGAPN clearly beats five
state-of-the-art baselines,

00:00:05.192 --> 00:00:10.371
reaching a best score near minus ten and a mean of
minus six point seven seven,

00:00:10.451 --> 00:00:15.697
well ahead of MolDQN, with an astronomically small
p-value under Welch's t-test.

00:00:15.777 --> 00:00:20.224
It also wins constrained optimization at every
similarity threshold,

00:00:20.304 --> 00:00:27.280
and in multi-objective mode trades slight affinity
for markedly better drug-likeness and synthesizability.
